# The Starter Map's Showcase Shapes: the building of overlapping prims in four materials (a stone
# base, brick walls and buttresses, a concrete arch, bands and roof slab, a copper dome), drawn with
# culling and without. Its geometry is checked: nothing kept inside another solid, nothing that shows
# lost, no flush faces drawn twice. Tube: culling.
world custom "custom maps/Starter Map.rmc"
map-name Starter Map / Showcase Shapes
camera 11.6 12.9 .8 40 6
scenery-only
size 1600 900
frames 12
step 0
culling-area 13.5 14 22 22
culling-fewer 1
culling-shot building
